# UI copy — no trailing period

Do not end user-facing strings with a period (`.`), ellipsis (`…` / `...`), or similar trailing punctuation.

Applies to toasts, status lines, button labels, settings titles/descriptions, nav titles, and other on-device copy.

```text
❌ Generating image…
❌ Cleared context.
✅ Generating image
✅ Cleared context
```

Exceptions: full sentences in long-form help/docs only if the product already uses them; default for heyvinu UI is short labels without a closing period.
